# An enterprise with a technical item as a part: the sketch draws Enterprise --hasPart--> only to
# Organizational Unit and Site, so SHACL must report this, and a reasoner must not re-type the pump.
@prefix : <https://w3id.org/plant-example#> .

:acme a :Enterprise ;
    :hasPart :pump1 .
:pump1 a :TechnicalItem .
